  {
   "id": "ruffy-and-the-riverside-143829@major-2025-08-08",
   "gameId": "ruffy-and-the-riverside-143829",
   "displayName": "Smooth camera update, tweaks to the fighting system and more!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-08-08T08:53:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The focus of this patch is a smoother player camera.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Before the player camera placement was updated on a fixed 60 FPS.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now in most cases the actual frame rate is used for the camera update, so the player camera now runs better if the screen and graphics card support higher frame rates. And even if the frame rate is only 60 FPS or lower, the camera movement should feel smoother now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many animated or moving objects had to be reworked to update on a higher frame rate as well to avoid stuttering because of distinct frame rates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Another noticeable change is the fighting system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The different attacks have been made more distinct to make fights slightly more challenging and strategic.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The punch attack now is more precise. It only hits objects in front of Ruffy. This makes it easier to hit a specific box on a tower of boxes. And hitting enemies will take a little effort now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The charge duration of the spin attack has been reduced to encourage players to use it more often. Also its range is higher now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The range of the stomp attack shock wave has also been increased.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update also contains many other small tweaks and bugfixes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "added a door and a white fade when leaving the town area through the small forest to avoid loading spikes in the small forest in front of town",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "changed how the camera follows the player in rivers if automatic camera alignment is enabled",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "when starting scan or throw, the camera zooms in faster now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed some multi throw selection issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "when one of the selected objects got destroyed, the selection crosses didn't disappear again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the selection crosses had some small delay when moving the camera fast",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "camera zooms in narrow areas changes faster now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "reduced the duration of some cutscenes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "enemies walk smoother in general",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "added some new sounds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed some sounds which weren't affected by the global volume setting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "reduced the amount of Ruffy voices",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
